# =============================================================================
# DEPRECATED: This file is no longer used
# =============================================================================
#
# As of v0.2.0, Caddyfile and Caddyfile.prod have been consolidated into a
# single Caddyfile that adapts to both development and production environments
# via environment variables.
#
# This file is kept temporarily for reference and to support the deployment
# script (scripts/magpie-deploy.sh) during the transition period.
#
# For new deployments:
# - Use docker-compose.yml for development (sets MAGPIE_SITE_ADDRESS=:80)
# - Use docker-compose.prod.yml for production (sets MAGPIE_SITE_ADDRESS,
#   MAGPIE_LOG_CONFIG, MAGPIE_ADMIN_CONFIG, and MAGPIE_SECURITY_HEADERS)
#
# See consolidated Caddyfile for the active configuration.
#
# Issue: https://github.com/SouthwestCCDC/magpie/issues/232
# =============================================================================
